UPSTREAM SERVICES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This module reads public Algorand infrastructure and bundles none of it:

  * Algorand algod / indexer REST APIs — Algorand Foundation / Algorand
    Technologies. https://developer.algorand.org
  * Default public endpoints: AlgoNode (https://algonode.io), keyless.
    Configurable via ALGORAND_ALGOD_URL / ALGORAND_INDEXER_URL.

